 forth","strong":"H3318"},{"text":"; the Ethiopians","strong":"H3568"},{"text":" and the Libyans","strong":"H6316"},{"text":", that handle","strong":"H8610"},{"text":" the shield","strong":"H4043"},{"text":"; and the Lydians","strong":"H3866"},{"text":", that handle","strong":"H8610"},{"text":" [and] bend","strong":"H1869"},{"text":" the bow","strong":"H7198"},{"text":". {the Ethiopians: Heb. Cush} {the Libyans: Heb. Put}"}]},{"id":20055,"title":"Jeremiah 46:10","segments":["For this [is] the day of the Lord GOD of hosts, a day of vengeance, that he may avenge him of his adversaries: and the sword shall devour, and it shall be satiate and made drunk with their blood: for the Lord GOD of hosts hath a sacrifice in the north country by the river Euphrates."],"ref":"Jeremiah 46:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"For this [is] the day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of the Lord","strong":"H136"},{"text":" GOD","strong":"H3069"},{"text":" of hosts","strong":"H6635"},{"text":", a day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of vengeance","strong":"H5360"},{"text":", that he may avenge","strong":"H5358"},{"text":" him of his adversaries","strong":"H6862"},{"text":": and the sword","strong":"H2719"},{"text":" shall devour","strong":"H398"},{"text":", and it shall be satiate","strong":"H7646"},{"text":" and made drunk","strong":"H7301"},{"text":" with their blood","strong":"H1818"},{"text":": for the Lord","strong":"H136"},{"text":" GOD","strong":"H3069"},{"text":" of hosts","strong":"H6635"},{"text":" hath a sacrifice","strong":"H2077"},{"text":" in the north","strong":"H6828"},{"text":" country","strong":"H776"},{"text":" by the river","strong":"H5104"},{"text":" Euphrates","strong":"H6578"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":20056,"title":"Jeremiah 46:11","segments":["Go up into Gilead, and take balm, O virgin, the daughter of Egypt: in vain shalt thou use many medicines; [for] thou shalt not be cured. {thou shalt...: Heb. no cure shall be unto thee}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 46:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":