":", saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":"; Behold, I will punish","strong":"H6485"},{"text":" the multitude","strong":"H527"},{"text":"","strong":"H528"},{"text":" of No","strong":"H4996"},{"text":", and Pharaoh","strong":"H6547"},{"text":", and Egypt","strong":"H4714"},{"text":", with their gods","strong":"H430"},{"text":", and their kings","strong":"H4428"},{"text":"; even Pharaoh","strong":"H6547"},{"text":", and [all] them that trust","strong":"H982"},{"text":" in him: {multitude: or, nourisher: Heb. Amon}"}]},{"id":20071,"title":"Jeremiah 46:26","segments":["And I will deliver them into the hand of those that seek their lives, and into the hand of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon, and into the hand of his servants: and afterward it shall be inhabited, as in the days of old, saith the LORD."],"ref":"Jeremiah 46:26","verse":26,"words":[{"text":"And I will deliver","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" them into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of those that seek","strong":"H1245"},{"text":" their lives","strong":"H5315"},{"text":", and into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of Nebuchadrezzar","strong":"H5019"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":", and into the hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" of his servants","strong":"H5650"},{"text":": and afterward","strong":"H310"},{"text":" it shall be inhabited","strong":"H7931"},{"text":", as in the days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of old","strong":"H6924"},{"text":", saith","strong":"H5002"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":20072,"title":"Jeremiah 46:27","segments":["But fear not thou, O my servant Jacob, and be not dismayed, O Israel: for, behold, I will save thee from afar off, and thy seed from the land of their captivity; and Jacob shall return, and be in rest and at ease, and none shall make [him] afraid."],"ref":"Jeremiah 46:27","verse":27,"words":[{"text":"But fear","strong":"H3372"},{"text":" not thou, O my servant","strong":"H5650"},{"text":" Jacob","strong":"H3290"},{"text":", and be not dismayed","strong":"H2865"},{"text":", O Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":": for, behold, I will save","strong":"H3467"},{"text":" thee from afar off","strong":"H7350"},{"text":", and thy seed","strong":"H2233"},{"text":" from the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" of their captivity","strong":"H7628"},{"text":"; and Jacob","strong":"H3290"},{"text":" shall return","strong":"H7725"},{"text":", and be in rest","strong":"H8252"},{"text":" and at ease","strong":"H7599"},{"text":", and none shall make [him] afraid","strong":"H2729"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":20073,"title":"Jeremiah 46:28","segments":["Fear thou not, O Jacob my servant, saith the LORD: for I [am] with thee; for I will make a full end of all the nations whither I have driven thee: but I will not make a full end of thee, but correct thee in measure; yet will I not leave thee wholly unpunished. {not leave...: or, not utterly cut thee off}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 46:28","verse":28,"words":[{"text":"Fear","strong":"H3372"},{"text":" thou not, O Jacob","strong":"H3290"},{"text":" my servant","strong":"H5650"},{"text":", saith","strong":"H5002"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":": for I [am] with thee; for I will make","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" a full end","strong":"H3617"},{"text":" of all the nations","strong":"H1471"},{"text":" whither I have driven","strong":"H5080"},{"text":" thee: but I will not make","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" a full end","strong":"H3617"},{"text":" of thee, but correct","strong":"H3256"},{"text":" thee in measure","strong":"H4941"},{"text":"; yet will I not leave thee wholly","strong":"H5352"},{"text":" unpunished","strong":"H5352"},{"text":". {not leave...: or, not utterly cut thee off}"}]}]}
